.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log
.shipward/*.tmp
.shipward/*.lock*
.shipward/last-write.json
# Worktrees live here (EnterWorktree, git worktree add). Each is a full second
# checkout, and .claude is a directory people add wholesale, so without this one
# line a stray `git add -A` commits an entire worktree into the repo.
.claude/worktrees/

# Third-party scaffolding this repo uses but does not own (SW-049). Untracked
# rather than deleted: these are live tooling in this working copy, and removing
# them from disk would break the sessions that depend on them. None ships a
# LICENSE, so none of it is ours to redistribute.
#
# What DOES stay tracked under .claude is the product's own: hooks/shipward.mjs,
# settings.json and the five commands — setup.mjs installs those into other
# repos, and CLAUDE.md documents them.
.claude/skills/
_bmad/

# Design handoff of uncertain redistribution rights, and working archives.
design_handoff_shipward/
*.zip
